Recommendations for Treatm ent of Cardiac Amyloidosis
Referenced studies that support the recommendations are summarized in the Online Data Supplements .
COR LOE RECOMMENDATIONS
1 B-R
1. In select patients with wild-type or variant transt hyretin cardiac amyloidosis and NYHA class I to III HF
symptoms, transthyretin tetramer stabilizer therap y (tafamidis) is indicated to reduce cardiovascular
morbidity and mortality ( 102).
2a C-LD
